---
import FeaturePage from "@/components/kit/FeaturePage.astro";
---
<FeaturePage
  mini="link-check"
  title="Link check"
  description="Figmafolio checks your Figma prototype link as you paste it and tells you if visitors can open it."
  lede="Paste a prototype link and Figmafolio tells you if anyone with the link can open it, before you send it to anyone."
  plan="Every plan, including the 7-day trial."
  steps={[
    { title: "Paste your prototype link", text: "Add it to the Desktop or Phone field. A design, file or branch link is changed into a prototype link, and you are told.", mini: "publish" },
    { title: "Read the note under the field", text: "A green line says anyone with the link can open the prototype.", mini: "link-ok" },
    { title: "Fix it if visitors cannot open it", text: "Show me how opens a short guide to Share, Anyone and View. Figmafolio checks again by itself and closes the guide when the link works.", mini: "link-fail" },
  ]}
  cards={[
    { title: "Checked as a visitor", text: "The check asks whether a stranger could open the prototype, not whether you can." },
    { title: "A guide in the form", text: "Show me how walks through the Share setting, so you do not have to leave the page to find it." },
    { title: "A warning on older sites", text: "A site tile in the dashboard warns you when its prototype is not shared, with a Fix sharing button." },
  ]}
  limits="The check never blocks saving or previewing. If it cannot run, it shows nothing. Boards, Make files and slides are not supported, because a site needs a prototype from a Figma Design file."
  faq={[
    { q: "What does a visitor see if the prototype is not shared?", a: "A Figma error instead of your site. That is what the check is there to catch." },
    { q: "What if I do not see the Anyone option in Figma?", a: "Your Figma admin may have turned off public links. Ask them to allow it." },
    { q: "Does it check again after I change the Figma setting?", a: "Yes. Press Check again, or leave the guide open and it re-checks every few seconds." },
  ]}
  related={[{ href: "/share-figma-prototype-anyone-can-open", label: "Share a Figma prototype so anyone can open it" }, { href: "/figma-prototype-to-website", label: "Figma prototype to website" }]}
  checked="2026-11-21"
/>
